message: "If you use ISAT, please cite the article below and the original paper of each index you report, and state the ISAT version."
title: "ISAT: Insulin Sensitivity Analysis Tool"
abstract: "Open-source tool that calculates surrogate indices of insulin sensitivity and resistance from fasting, OGTT, lipid and body measurements. Runs in the web browser (data stay local) and as a standalone Linux command-line tool for large cohorts."
type: software
